msgid ""
"BFpack does not accept factor levels that contain spaces. Please remove the"
"spaces from your factor levels to continue."
msgstr ""
"BFpack不接受包含空格的因子水平。请移除因子水平中的空格以继续。"

msgid "Only two variables can be specified for the paired samples t-test."
msgstr "配对样本t检验只能指定两个变量。"

#, qt-format
msgid "The parameter estimation failed. Error message: %1$s"
msgstr "参数估计失败。错误消息：%1$s"

#, qt-format
msgid "Could not extract parameter names. Error message: %1$s"
msgstr "无法提取参数名称。错误消息：%1$s"

msgid ""
"BFpack does not accept factor levels that start with a number. Please remove"
"the numbers from your factor levels to continue."
msgstr ""
"BFpack不接受以数字开头的因子水平。请移除因子水平中的数字以继续。"

msgid ""
"BFpack failed because of an issue with the specification of the manual"
"hypotheses. Please check that you specified them correctly. You should then"
"refresh the analysis."
msgstr ""
"BFpack因手动假设的设定问题而失败。请检查您是否正确设定了这些假设，然后刷新分析。"

#, qt-format
msgid "BFpack failed with the following error message: %1$s"
msgstr "BFpack失败，错误消息如下：%1$s"

msgid "Posterior Probabilities of the Standard Hypotheses"
msgstr "标准假设的后验概率"

msgid "Equal Variances"
msgstr "等方差"

msgid "Unequal Variances"
msgstr "异方差"

msgid "Pr(H0|Data)"
msgstr "Pr(H0|数据)"

msgid "Pr(H±|Data)"
msgstr "Pr(H±|数据)"

msgid "Pr(H-|Data)"
msgstr "Pr(H-|数据)"

msgid "Pr(H+|Data)"
msgstr "Pr(H+|数据)"

#, qt-format
msgid "%1$sGroup %2$s corresponds to level %3$s in variable %4$s. "
msgstr "%1$s组%2$s对应于变量%4$s中的水平%3$s。 "

msgid "Prior probabilities of hypotheses H0 and H±:"
msgstr "假设H0和H±的先验概率："

msgid "Prior probabilities of hypotheses H0, H- and H+: "
msgstr "假设H0、H-和H+的先验概率： "

#, qt-format
msgid ""
"R-hat values for the posterior samples of the correlation coefficients are"
"larger than 1.05.                                            This indicates"
"that the chains have not converged well."
"If you used the 'LD' sampling method try decreasing the nugget parameter or"
"running the chains for more iterations."
"The following variables have R-hat > 1.05: %1$s."
msgstr ""
"相关系数后验样本的R-hat值大于1.05。这表示链未能很好地收敛。"
"如果您使用了“LD”采样方法，请尝试减小nugget参数或让链运行更多迭代。"
"以下变量的R-hat > 1.05：%1$s。"

msgid ""
"The multivariate R-hat value is larger than 1.05, indicating that the chains"
"have not converged well.                               If you used the 'LD'"
"sampling method try decreasing the nugget parameter or running the chains for"
"more iterations."
msgstr ""
"多元R-hat值大于1.05，表示链未能很好地收敛。"
"如果您使用了“LD”采样方法，请尝试减小nugget参数或让链运行更多迭代。"

msgid ""
"The number of factor levels in the grouping is greater than 2."
"Only the first two levels were used."
msgstr ""
"分组变量中的因子水平数大于2。仅使用了前两个水平。"

msgid "Posterior Probabilities for Main Effects"
msgstr "主效应的后验概率"

msgid "Pr(No effect)"
msgstr "Pr(无效应)"

msgid "Pr(Full Model)"
msgstr "Pr(全模型)"

#, qt-format
msgid "Prior probabilities of the main effects: %1$s."
msgstr "主效应的先验概率：%1$s。"

